      "example": "I like working from home, but only under a very specific condition — no meetings before ten.",
      "usage_note": "后面常接 that 从句或破折号解释条件。"
    },
    {
      "expression": "my brain checks out",
      "meaning_zh": "我的大脑就停止运转了／走神了",
      "why_useful": "口语中自然表达失去兴趣或注意力，比 I lose interest 更生动。",
      "example": "If a lecture is too easy, my brain checks out after ten minutes.",
      "usage_note": "非正式表达，适合口语，不适合正式写作。"
    },
    {
      "expression": "the fun is basically over",
      "meaning_zh": "乐趣基本上就结束了",
      "why_useful": "简洁说明某个阶段后兴趣消失，可用于爱好、活动、项目等话题。",
      "example": "Once the puzzle is solved, the fun is basically over for me.",
      "usage_note": "basically 可替换为 pretty much，语气更口语。"
    }
  ]
